      "color": "orange",
      "text": "Front Panel. Chart-led editorial: every page opens on one large numbered figure, with the words set around it.\n\nLayout: 12-column editorial grid, no boxes; question left, a large figure right; generous vertical rhythm.\nThe memorable thing: Figure 1 on every page: the chart is the headline, captions carry the argument.\nType: Bricolage Grotesque 800 for headlines and figures' numbers; Geist 400–700 for text, tables and charts.\nLight: bg #F4F5F0, surf #FFFFFF, ink #111311, muted #5B625B, acc #1B6B50, line #C9CEC3\nDark: bg #0F1311, surf #151A17, ink #E9EEEA, muted #8E9892, acc #4FD1A5, line #2A332E\nMagnet rail on the right edge. Live prices on these boards are NSE closing prices from 25 Sep 2026; every chart is drawn from real data or the project's pricer."
    }
